1
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:28,500
I walked back up the silent wooden stairs,

2
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,500
The vinyl clicking softly at the end.

3
00:00:37,799 --> 00:00:41,000
I carried you and laid you on the bed,

4
00:00:43,799 --> 00:00:48,000
Not knowing what the shadows might portend.

5
00:00:50,299 --> 00:00:54,000
Your mother told me of the inner dark,

6
00:00:56,500 --> 00:01:00,000
The wall that rises when a man gets near.

7
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:06,500
A helpless shield against an old abuse,

8
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:12,500
That turns your gentle heart to primal fear.

9
00:01:18,799 --> 00:01:22,000
You stumbled to the kitchen in the pale,

10
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:28,500
And saw the marks and bruises on my frame.

11
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:34,799
You crouched upon the floor in sheer despair,

12
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:41,500
And wept in guilt, taking all the blame.

13
00:01:43,799 --> 00:01:47,500
You screamed at me to run away and flee,

14
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:53,500
To save myself before you break my soul.

15
00:01:56,500 --> 00:02:00,000
My instinct screamed to turn around and run,

16
00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:06,500
To let the cold logic take control.

17
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:12,500
I knelt before you on the kitchen floor,

18
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:19,000
And took your trembling wrists within my hands.

19
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:25,500
I looked into the dark depth of your eyes,

20
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:31,500
Where no one else ever understands.

21
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:37,500
I’m not going anywhere, do you hear?

22
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:44,000
I will not run or leave you in the night.

23
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:50,500
You let your tears fall heavy on my chest,

24
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:57,000
As the lion holds you in the light.

25
00:03:00,500 --> 00:03:03,000
Under spotlights, easy lead,

26
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:06,500
In the glow of golden light.

27
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:09,500
Cold dark tiles upon the floor,

28
00:03:12,099 --> 00:03:18,099
It's the first true lion's dance tonight.